{"openIssues": 4, "changelog": [{"tagName": "1.1.0", "name": "1.1.0", "createdAt": "2022-08-28T09:17:43Z", "body": "* 新增蓝牙通告数据同步功能（用以调试动态广播设备）\r\n* `Advertising` 现在被翻译为 `通告`（根据开发者文档）", "assets": [{"name": "BluetoothAdvertisingListener-1.0.0-1-release.apk", "downloadUrl": "https://github.com/Xposed-Modules-Repo/com.ztc1997.mockbluetoothdevice/releases/download/1.1.0/BluetoothAdvertisingListener-1.0.0-1-release.apk", "size": 1048800, "downloadCount": 1414}]}, {"tagName": "4-1.0.3", "name": "1.0.3", "createdAt": "2022-08-28T09:17:43Z", "body": "* 修复 `MAC 地址`显示问题", "assets": [{"name": "app-release.apk", "downloadUrl": "https://github.com/Xposed-Modules-Repo/com.ztc1997.mockbluetoothdevice/releases/download/4-1.0.3/app-release.apk", "size": 37986, "downloadCount": 9473}]}, {"tagName": "3-1.0.2", "name": "1.0.2", "createdAt": "2022-08-27T07:09:22Z", "body": "* 检查输入参数的合法性\r\n* 去除无用权限", "assets": [{"name": "app-release.apk", "downloadUrl": "https://github.com/Xposed-Modules-Repo/com.ztc1997.mockbluetoothdevice/releases/download/3-1.0.2/app-release.apk", "size": 37990, "downloadCount": 180}]}, {"tagName": "2-1.0.1", "name": "1.0.1", "createdAt": "2022-08-27T07:09:22Z", "body": "* 修复开关显示问题\r\n* 支持 Android 8.0 或更高版本", "assets": [{"name": "app-release.apk", "downloadUrl": "https://github.com/Xposed-Modules-Repo/com.ztc1997.mockbluetoothdevice/releases/download/2-1.0.1/app-release.apk", "size": 33346, "downloadCount": 188}]}, {"tagName": "1-1.0.0", "name": "1.0.0", "createdAt": "2022-08-27T05:28:01Z", "body": "* 首次发布", "assets": [{"name": "app-release.apk", "downloadUrl": "https://github.com/Xposed-Modules-Repo/com.ztc1997.mockbluetoothdevice/releases/download/1-1.0.0/app-release.apk", "size": 42274, "downloadCount": 116}]}], "contributors": ["ztc1997"], "readme": "# 模拟蓝牙设备\n此项目已停止维护，如果你在最近有过捐款，可以通过email联系我退回\n\n在蓝牙扫描结果中模拟一个 BLE 外围设备通告。  \n支持动态通告数据同步，需要另一台 Android 5.0 以上的设备作为监听设备，安装`蓝牙通告监听器`，并创建一个[LeanCloud](https://www.leancloud.cn/) 应用用于云端同步。  \n仅用于蓝牙设备的开发与调试，请勿用于签到打卡等违法违纪用途。\n## 使用说明\n关闭模块状态下，使用 nRF Connect 扫描得到要模拟的通告信号，将结果填入对应选项。\n* `Raw data` 去掉开头的 `0x` 填入`通告数据`\n* 支持 Android 8.0 或更高版本\n\n<img align=\"center\" alt=\"howto\" src=\"https://github.com/Xposed-Modules-Repo/com.ztc1997.mockbluetoothdevice/raw/main/img/howto.jpg\"/>\n"}